 style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #D9D5DF"></span></div><div class="flex h-full items-center gap-3 p-3" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7E5EA"><span class="h-9 w-9 flex-none" style="background:#F1EFF3"></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block truncate text-[13.5px] font-semibold leading-tight text-[#17141A]">Prediction Markets</span><span class="mt-[3px] block truncate text-[10px] font-medium leading-tight text-[#8C8A93]" style="font-family:var(--font-v2-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;letter-spacing:.06em">FORECASTING</span></span><span class="h-[10px] w-[10px] flex-none" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #D9D5DF"></span></div><div class="flex h-full items-center gap-3 p-3" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7E5EA"><span class="h-9 w-9 flex-none" style="background:#F1EFF3"></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block truncate text-[13.5px] font-semibold leading-tight text-[#17141A]">Transportation</span><span class="mt-[3px] block truncate text-[10px] font-medium leading-tight text-[#8C8A93]" style="font-family:var(--font-v2-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;letter-spacing:.06em">TRANSIT DATA</span></span><span class="h-[10px] w-[10px] flex-none" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #D9D5DF"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-wrapper w-full" data-cta-location="v2Faq" data-cta-block-type="v2Faq" data-cta-block-index="3"><div class="section-container relative w-full border-x !border-0 !border-t-0 !border-b-0 !border-l-0 !border-r-0"><div class="v2-scope bg-white border-t border-[#E7E5EA]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1360px] grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] lg:gap-20 lg:py-[104px]"><h2 class="m-0 font-medium text-[#17141A]" style="font-family:var(--font-v2-serif), Georgia, serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 2.9vw, 36px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.015em">FAQs</h2><div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#17141A">What happens if I use more than my monthly credits?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#5E3454">−</span></button><div class="whitespace-pre-line pb-6 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-[#54525c]">Once your monthly credits are used, requests draw on any top-up credits you have. When your balance hits zero, new requests are paused until you add credits, so you never get a surprise overage bill. We email you at 80% and 95% of your monthly credits, and you can turn on auto top-up to keep requests running.</div></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">Can I switch plans mid-month?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">Why do different data sources cost different amounts?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">How does Search API pricing work?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">How does Answer API pricing work?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">How does DeepResearch pricing work?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-[#E2DEE5] first:border-t"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors" style="color:#54525c">What happens when I run out of credits?<span class="flex-none text-[18px] font-normal leading-none" style="color:#b3aeb8">+</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></section></article><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="v2-scope _9q6SwW_ft" data-cta-location="footer"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1360px] px-5 sm:px-10 _9q6SwW_ft__in"><div class="_9q6SwW_fc__top"><p class="_9q6SwW_fc__say">Search and deep research APIs for AI, in finance and the sciences.</p><a class="_9q6SwW_btt" href="#top">Back to top <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></div><nav class="_9q6SwW_fc__cols" aria-label="Footer"><h2 class="_9q6SwW_vh">Footer</h2><div class="_9q6SwW_grp"><h3 class="_9q6SwW_grp__h">Product</h3><ul><li><a href="/product/apis">APIs</a></li><li><a href="/product/agents">Agents</a></li><li><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.valyu.ai/integrations/mcp-server">MCP</a></li></ul></div><div class="_9q6SwW_fc__sol"><h3 class="_9q6SwW_grp__h">Industry</h3><div class="_9q6SwW_fc__sol2"><div class="_9q6SwW_grp _9q6SwW_grp--plum"><h4 class="_9q6SwW_grp__h">Finance</